<title>USA: Multicanal names Roberto Waddington CFO.</title>
<headline>Multicanal names Roberto Waddington CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Multicanal Participacoes SA said Friday that it named Roberto Waddington chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The company said he replaces Arnaldo Silva Amaral, who is leaving the company.</p>
<p>Waddington had been general manager of PepsiCo's beverage division in Sao Paulo.</p>
<p>Multicanal is a cable television operator in Brazil.</p>
